"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[35158],{35158:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/ccf7bf8c67b43d0aa4a0eb915859de54.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Cheonghakdong Chic Naengmyeon\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Korean > Naengmyeon\\"\\n  address=\\"466, Hyoheng-ro, Byeongjeom-gu, Hwaseong-si, Gyeonggi-do\\"\\n  rating=4.5\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\n<mark>Cheonghakdong Chic Naengmyeon</mark> is a famous naengmyeon restaurant, so it is always crowded whenever you go.  \\nStill, the parking lot is large and well-equipped, and the inside of the restaurant is quite spacious, so even if there is a wait, the turnover rate is high and you don\'t have to wait very long before being guided to a seat.  \\n\\nUpon entering the restaurant, you order at the counter first and make a `prepayment`.  \\nOnce payment is done, the staff guides you to a seat.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nThe <mark>seasoning (dadeqi)</mark> here is on the spicy side, so if you cannot eat spicy food well, it would be better to avoid bibim-naengmyeon.  \\nAlternatively, you can ask for the seasoning to be less spicy when ordering.  \\n\\nWe ordered one regular `mul-naengmyeon` and one `large mul-naengmyeon`.  \\nOrdering the `large` size didn\'t dramatically increase the portion, it was just slightly more noodles.  \\nStill, if you are going to eat it anyway, I would recommend <mark>ordering the large size</mark>.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\n`Chic (arrowroot) water` and `warm broth` are self-served.  \\nIf you take a sip of the warm broth, you can immediately feel that the broth is quite rich, and even this single cup made me realize that this place is a true local favorite.  \\n\\nAfter drinking the broth and waiting for a short while, the ordered dishes came out faster than expected.  \\nThe phrase \\"high turnover rate\\" was truly felt in moments like this.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nAlthough you can add mustard and vinegar, I personally recommend eating it <mark>plain (as-is)</mark>.  \\nThat alone was rich enough in flavor, leaving absolutely no regrets.  \\n\\nAs rumored, it was indeed a great restaurant.\\n## Pictures\\n\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/ccf7bf8c67b43d0aa4a0eb915859de54.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Cheonghakdong Chic Naengmyeon\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/9de38855f38fcd51067d66d633c0544e.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Cheonghakdong Chic Naengmyeon\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);